00:01:00.219 --> 00:01:25.989
We've learned to control.

00:01:25.989 --> 00:01:29.989
Just a heart that pounds.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:31.989
Davis, is everything okay?

00:01:31.989 --> 00:01:33.989
I'm sorry if I walk you, I...

