00:02:38.229 --> 00:02:41.229
I wanted to surprise you.

00:02:41.229 --> 00:02:44.340
It's beautiful.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.879
But I don't remember ever seeing a box of candles down here.

00:02:48.879 --> 00:02:49.879
down here.

00:02:49.879 --> 00:02:50.879
We're flowers.

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:52.879
There weren't any?

00:02:52.879 --> 00:02:56.379
Davis.

00:02:56.379 --> 00:02:58.379
We talked about this.

00:02:58.379 --> 00:03:01.379
You can't leave the basement.

00:03:01.379 --> 00:03:03.379
I was careful.

00:03:03.379 --> 00:03:04.379
I know how much you're risking by helping me.

00:03:04.379 --> 00:03:06.379
