00:03:06.379 --> 00:03:07.379
I don't need thanks.

00:03:07.379 --> 00:03:08.379
I need to be able to trust you.

00:03:08.379 --> 00:03:09.379
I won't do it again.

00:03:09.379 --> 00:03:10.379
Sorry.

00:03:10.379 --> 00:03:18.419
Chloe.

00:03:18.419 --> 00:03:25.919
Well, friends help each other, right?

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:30.800
Friends help you move.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.800
They take you to the airport.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:35.800
You can't think that's really all this is.

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:39.229
Okay.

00:03:39.229 --> 00:03:42.530
So maybe it was a 9.9 on the Richter scale of favors, Davis.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:44.129
But that doesn't change our relationships.

00:03:44.129 --> 00:03:45.229
But we...

00:03:45.229 --> 00:03:48.930
We met in a flurry of smoking ash and burnt out cars.

00:03:48.930 --> 00:03:51.229
People freaking out for a moment there.

00:03:51.229 --> 00:03:55.229
It felt like everything disappeared except us.

00:03:55.229 --> 00:04:04.370
Feelings haven't changed.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:08.000
I do care about you, Davis.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.000
But...

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:15.479
Stay without you.

00:04:15.479 --> 00:05:11.180
The man that I want to be doesn't exist.

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.180
Davis is that blood?

00:05:13.180 --> 00:07:12.110
You usually make Capitino's blindfold.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.110
it. Clark, hey.

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:17.110
Yeah, I just didn't get my full seven hours of sleep last night.

00:07:17.110 --> 00:07:24.149
Judging from the look on your face, you didn't come here to join me for pancakes.

00:07:24.149 --> 00:07:27.149
Tess named Davis, a serial killer.

00:07:27.149 --> 00:07:31.149
She devoted the whole front page of today's paper to the story.

00:07:31.149 --> 00:07:36.959
Headlines can't hurt Davis now that he's dead.

00:07:36.959 --> 00:07:39.959
That's the thing, Chloe. I'm starting to believe that Davis is still alive.

00:07:39.959 --> 00:07:45.839
We both watched him die.

00:07:45.839 --> 00:07:47.839
Oliver buried the body.

00:07:47.839 --> 00:07:50.839
It says in this article, they found one of Bruno Mannheim Stuggs in a dumpster, torn upon a

00:07:50.839 --> 00:07:55.839
dumpster, torn apart, the same way that doomsday dismembered his victims.

00:07:55.839 --> 00:07:58.839
That body was probably there for weeks.

00:07:58.839 --> 00:08:00.839
The murder happened after Davis died.

00:08:00.839 --> 00:08:06.430
I love a good ghost story just as much as the next girl,

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:11.430
but there has to be a more logical explanation than the resurrection of an alien monster.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:14.430
There could be a copycat killer.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.430
Chloe, he's come back from the dead before.

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:19.430
Not from Meteor Rock.

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:26.939
Clark, I understand why you're paranoid. Davis was sent here to kill you.

00:08:26.939 --> 00:08:28.939
was sent here to kill you.

00:08:28.939 --> 00:08:34.309
I mean, that would make anyone believe there were monsters under their bed.

00:08:34.309 --> 00:08:36.309
It doesn't change the fact that Davis is a murderer.

00:08:36.309 --> 00:08:38.309
But, Clark, Davis is dead.

00:08:38.309 --> 00:08:42.309
And the only thing that's keeping him alive in your mind is fear.

00:08:42.309 --> 00:08:45.309
Let him go.

00:08:45.309 --> 00:08:58.029
Gentlemen, Luther Corp is going green,

00:08:58.029 --> 00:09:00.029
and I certainly don't want all the old money investors

00:09:00.029 --> 00:09:03.029
to think we're wasting all of their money on hemp bracelets,

00:09:03.029 --> 00:09:06.029
so we could send some cameras into the geothermal energy facility.

00:09:06.029 --> 00:09:09.029
It's innovative. It's profitable.

00:09:09.029 --> 00:09:10.029
Okay. Perfect.

00:09:10.029 --> 00:09:11.029
Perfect.

00:09:11.029 --> 00:09:12.029
Call tests.

00:09:12.029 --> 00:09:13.029
A range of press release.

00:09:13.029 --> 00:09:16.029
Nothing screams photo up like a 10-mile hole in the ground, right?

00:09:16.029 --> 00:09:21.009
Hey, Oliver.

00:09:21.009 --> 00:09:23.009
Can we talk for a quick sec?

00:09:23.009 --> 00:09:24.009
Hey, Jimmy.

00:09:24.009 --> 00:09:27.009
Not the greatest time right now, actually.

00:09:27.009 --> 00:09:29.009
I wouldn't ask if wasn't important.

00:09:29.009 --> 00:09:31.009
Okay.

00:09:31.009 --> 00:09:33.009
Gentlemen?

00:09:33.009 --> 00:09:34.009
Excuse me.

00:09:34.009 --> 00:09:37.700
